02:33:21,359 --> 02:33:37,040
Optimus, Grok, et cetera. Not just yours, but any revenue-maximizing company's products will be leveraged by the government over time. How does this concern manifest in what

706
02:33:37,040 --> 02:33:51,040
private companies should be willing to give governments? What kinds of guardrails? Should AI models be made to do whatever the government that has contracted

707
02:33:51,040 --> 02:34:01,040
