754
02:44:51,680 --> 02:45:07,600
you're not for whatever reasons right now? There are a few companies that are pursuing new ways of doing chips, but they're just not scaling fast. I don't even mean within AI, I mean just generally.

755
02:45:07,600 --> 02:45:21,520
People should do the thing where they find that they're highly motivated to do that thing, as opposed to some idea that I suggest. They should do the thing that they find

756
02:45:21,520 --> 02:45:47,920
