757
02:45:47,920 --> 02:46:02,640
three to four year timeframe, it's chips. In the one year timeframe, it's energy, power production, electricity. It's not clear to me that there's enough

758
02:46:02,640 --> 02:46:13,040
usable electricity to turn on all the AI chips that are being made. Towards the end of this year, I think people are going to have real trouble turning on...

759
02:46:13,040 --> 02:46:24,800
The chip output will exceed the ability to turn chips on. What's your plan to deal with that world? We're trying to accelerate electricity production.

760
02:46:24,800 --> 02:46:39,279
I guess that's maybe one of the reasons that xAI will be maybe the leader, hopefully the leader. We'll be able to turn on more chips than other people can turn on, faster,

761
02:46:39,279 --> 02:46:54,399
because we're good at hardware. Generally, the innovations from the corporations that call themselves labs, the ideas tend to flow… It's rare to see that

762
02:46:54,399 --> 02:47:11,680
